#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:97
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Wireplumber"
msgstr "Instalação do Wireplumber"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:100
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Wireplumber</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>Wireplumber</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:104
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release -Dsystem-lua=true .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release -Dsystem-lua=true .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:111
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue: <command>ninja test</command>."
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>ninja test</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:115
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:118
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:123
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dsystem-lua=true</parameter>: This switch enables using the "
"system version of Lua. Omit this switch if you have not installed Lua, but "
"note that <application>meson</application> will download and install it's "
"own version."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dsystem-lua=true</parameter>: Essa chave habilita usar a versão "
"do sistema de Lua. Omita essa chave se você não tiver instalado Lua, mas "
"observe que <application>meson</application> baixará e instalará a própria "
"versão dele."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:138
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring Wireplumber"
msgstr "Configurando Wireplumber"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:140
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:143
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"In order for Wireplumber to be used by Pipewire, Wireplumber must be "
"configured to start when a desktop environment is started."
msgstr ""
"Para a finalidade de que o Wireplumber seja usado pelo Pipewire, o "
"Wireplumber precisa ser configurado para iniciar quando um ambiente de área "
"de trabalho for iniciado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:148
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To configure Wireplumber to start when a desktop environment is started, run"
" the following commands as the &root; user to enable the systemd user units:"
msgstr ""
"Para configurar o Wireplumber para iniciar quando um ambiente de área de "
"trabalho for iniciado, execute os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) "
"&root; para habilitar as unidades de usuário(a) do systemd:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:153
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>systemctl enable --global pipewire.socket &amp;&amp;\n"
"systemctl enable --global wireplumber</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>systemctl enable --global pipewire.socket &amp;&amp;\n"
"systemctl enable --global wireplumber</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:157
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"First, create a shell script that will start Wireplumber and Pipewire in the"
" correct order as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, crie um conjunto de comandos sequenciais de shell que iniciará o "
"Wireplumber e o Pipewire, na ordem correta, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:161
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /usr/bin/pipewire-launcher.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>#!/bin/sh\n"
"# Begin /usr/bin/pipewire-launcher.sh\n"
"\n"
"# Start Pipewire first.\n"
"exec /usr/bin/pipewire &amp;\n"
"\n"
"# Wait for a second for Pipewire to launch.\n"
"sleep 1\n"
"\n"
"# Start Wireplumber now that Pipewire has been started.\n"
"exec /usr/bin/wireplumber &amp;\n"
"# End /usr/bin/pipewire-launcher.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /usr/bin/pipewire-launcher.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>#!/bin/sh\n"
"# Inicia /usr/bin/pipewire-launcher.sh\n"
"\n"
"# Inicia Pipewire primeiro.\n"
"exec /usr/bin/pipewire &amp;\n"
"\n"
"# Espera por um segundo para Pipewire iniciar.\n"
"sleep 1\n"
"\n"
"# Inicia Wireplumber agora que Pipewire tenha sido iniciado.\n"
"exec /usr/bin/wireplumber &amp;\n"
"# Termina /usr/bin/pipewire-launcher.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:177
#, xml-text
msgid "Next, make this shell script executable as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"A seguir, torne esse conjunto de comandos sequenciais de shell executável "
"como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:180
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>chmod +x /usr/bin/pipewire-launcher.sh</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>chmod +x /usr/bin/pipewire-launcher.sh</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:183
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Finally, create an XDG Autostart file that will run "
"<command>/usr/bin/pipewire-launcher.sh</command> when a desktop environment "
"is started, as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Finalmente, crie um arquivo de auto iniciação do XDG que executará "
"<command>/usr/bin/pipewire-launcher.sh</command> quando um ambiente de área "
"de trabalho for iniciado; como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:188
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/xdg/autostart/pipewire.desktop &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Version=1.0\n"
"Name=Pipewire\n"
"Comment=Starts the Pipewire and Wireplumber daemons\n"
"Exec=/usr/bin/pipewire-launcher.sh\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Type=Application</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/xdg/autostart/pipewire.desktop &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Version=1.0\n"
"Name=Pipewire\n"
"Comment=Inicia os processos de segundo plano Pipewire e Wireplumber\n"
"Exec=/usr/bin/pipewire-launcher.sh\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Type=Application</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:199
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Now that Wireplumber is configured to start when a desktop environment is "
"started, it is recommended that you log out of your session and log back in "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Agora que o Wireplumber está configurado para iniciar quando um ambiente de "
"área de trabalho for iniciado, é recomendado que você se deslogue da teu "
"sessão e se logue novamente."

